$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=lswinreglem1  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for lswinreg: r |-> r f maps the squarefree cofactors r coprime to f with r f <_ N bijectively onto the moduli q <_ N having f as a DIV-divisor.

